Use dedicated durable browser signing material; fix per-call random-secret fallback. Authenticate callback identity and enforce admission policy; validate OAuth state, expiry, redirect targets and relevant PKCE behavior. Secure cookie settings, logout/revocation policy, CSRF/origin checks, and no mutating GET. Acceptance: session restart survival, rejected callbacks/CSRF, expiry, logout, and both secret configuration paths tested; browser identity matches API user.
